      Check your connections and data source and try again.
|----------E61.B00
No RAM
      The programmer has determined that it has no working data RAM installed.

      Replace faulty RAM or contact your local service center.
|----------E62.B00
RAM bit error
      The programmer has detected a fault in its data RAM.

      Replace faulty RAM or contact your local service center.
|----------E63.1F18
RAM write error
      Data stored to programmer RAM did not read back correctly.

      Try operation again.  If error persists, contact your local
      service center.
|----------E64.1F1F
RAM data error
      The programmer detected a spurious change in its data RAM.

      Data should be reloaded into RAM.  If this error persists,
      contact your local service center.
|----------E65.910
Pak firmware error
      The programmer has determined that the software in the program
      Pak installed in the programmer is faulty.

      Contact your local service center.
|----------E65.200
RAM bit error
      The programmer has detected a fault in its data RAM in the
      second pass of its RAM test.

      Replace faulty RAM or contact your local service center.
